I don't understand
what just happened.

748
00:51:53.511 --> 00:51:55.646
Did we just win. or did we lose?

749
00:51:55.713 --> 00:51:57.215
Both. kind of.

750
00:51:57.282 --> 00:52:00.718
Case got kicked.
but we're still open.

751
00:52:00.785 --> 00:52:02.420
That doesn't make any sense.

752
00:52:02.487 --> 00:52:03.964
No. it's the law.
It's not supposed to.

753
00:52:03.988 --> 00:52:07.091
Bottom line is.
is we're still in the game.

754
00:52:07.192 --> 00:52:08.459
That's the good news.

755
00:52:22.907 --> 00:52:25.210
Get back!

756
00:52:25.243 --> 00:52:27.312
Clear back! Come on!

757
00:52:28.213 --> 00:52:29.747
Woman: Somebody call 911!

758
00:52:29.814 --> 00:52:31.716
Man: I will!

759
00:52:31.782 --> 00:52:32.817
Rachel?

760
00:52:35.220 --> 00:52:36.587
Rachel.

761
00:54:22.192 --> 00:54:23.794
You stinker!

762
00:54:27.760 --> 00:54:32.960
Resynced and corrections
by Dan4Jem. XII.MMXVI
